WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.340
Eddy and his friends raced.

2
00:00:16.341 --> 00:00:36.676
They drove around the racetrack.

3
00:00:36.677 --> 00:00:40.250
"Eddy won!" cried Poppy.

4
00:00:40.251 --> 00:00:44.133
"Let's race again!" said Eddy.

5
00:00:44.134 --> 00:00:47.327
"Yeah!" said Dipper.

6
00:00:47.328 --> 00:00:50.821
"Racing is fun!"

7
00:00:50.822 --> 00:00:55.098
"You're too fast, Eddy," said Jeb.

8
00:00:55.099 --> 00:00:58.184
"You win all the time."

9
00:00:58.185 --> 00:01:04.223
"Let's play tag," said Dipper.

10
00:01:04.224 --> 00:01:13.907
"I love tag," said Poppy.

11
00:01:13.908 --> 00:01:16.653
She tagged Eddy.

12
00:01:16.654 --> 00:01:19.622
"You're it!" said Poppy.

13
00:01:19.623 --> 00:01:21.638
She took off.

14
00:01:21.639 --> 00:01:30.729
Eddy started to follow.

15
00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:34.262
"I don't like tag," said Jeb.

16
00:01:34.263 --> 00:01:42.608
"I'm too slow for it."

17
00:01:42.609 --> 00:01:45.719
Poppy and Eddy came back.

18
00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:49.038
"Hmm," said Poppy.

19
00:01:49.039 --> 00:01:52.070
"Let's tell funny jokes.

20
00:01:52.071 --> 00:01:55.474
Tell a funny joke, Jeb!"

21
00:01:55.475 --> 00:01:59.033
"Um," said Jeb.

22
00:01:59.034 --> 00:02:02.779
"I don't know any funny jokes."

23
00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:05.991
Jeb sighed.

24
00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:12.225
"I'm not really good at anything."

